{
  "_note": [
    "game_play 驱动（run.py）的**唯一输入**：一次运行 = 一份这样的配置。",
    "· testDir = 题目（玩法）目录（只读）；workDir = 这次运行的工作区（可写，产物都落那儿）。",
    "· 两个目录之外的字段都是**与题目无关**的调参（llm / 轮次 / tsc / agent bin / stopWhen / 编译归档…），缺哪项用内置默认。",
    "· 相对路径一律按**仓库根**解析（不是 CWD）⇒ 同一份配置在哪儿调用都指向同一处；绝对路径原样。",
    "· 产出脚本的起点**一律是空的**（工作区首次生成 play/play.ts 时只写一份空骨架，不给任何现成解法）。",
    "用法：python auto_code/game_play/run.py [run.json] [--dry-run|--no-agent]"
  ],
  "testDir": "auto_code/game_play/game/hello",
  "workDir": "build/auto_code/game_play/hello",

  "cfg": "Debug",
  "llm": {
    "url": "http://192.168.111.1:8080/v1/chat/completions",
    "name": "my_model",
    "token": "",
    "netTimeoutMs": 120000,
    "maxRounds": 100
  },
  "agent": {
    "enabled": true,
    "bin": "../../build/binary/agent_cli/Debug/agent_cli.exe",
    "readySec": 120,
    "required": true,
    "restart": true
  },
  "rounds": { "max": 10, "timeoutSec": 3600, "stallRounds": 3, "retrySec": 5 },
  "stopWhen": "verify-pass",
  "agentDrainSec": 1800,
  "build": true,
  "archive": true
}
